        "date": "2026-08-19T21:01:18Z"
      },
      "message": "moved mkdocs bibliography hook from top-level hooks/ into docs/hooks/\n\nKeeps the repository root clean by grouping the hook with the rest of the\ndocumentation. Since mkdocs copies every non-Markdown file in docs_dir into\nthe generated site, docs/hooks/ is excluded via exclude_docs so that neither\nbibliography.py nor its __pycache__ get published.\n\nThe hook resolves papers.bib through config[\"docs_dir\"], so relocating the\nfile does not affect its behaviour. It is now also covered by the docs/**\nglob in REUSE.toml.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "5226b4e8e02327037bdc8bece878b6f350957019",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/awietek/xdiag/git/trees/5226b4e8e02327037bdc8bece878b6f350957019"
